{"overview":"پدر و پسر در تصادفی در مسیر بیمارستان می‌میرند؛ پزشک قانونی اعلام می‌کند که پسر ۸٫۵ دقیقه زودتر از پدر جان سوزیده است. بر اساس قانون، تمام ارث به پسر کوچکتر، احسان، می‌رسد، در حالی که یکتا، همسر برادرش، در مشکل مالی است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A father and son die in an accident on their way to the hospital. The coroner declares that the son died 8.5 minutes before the father. According to the law, the entire inheritance goes to the younger son, Ehsan, while Yekta, his brother's wife, is in financial trouble...","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":29,"y":2016,"poster":""}],"episodes":29,"crew":["Shahram Shah Hosseini"],"crew_en":[],"countries":[],"cast":[{"name":"پژمان بازغی","role":"","photo":"/zZq0bE3IghI4BcpmcAZYrg2zrn7.jpg","en":"Pejman Bazeghi"},{"name":"Shabnam Gholikhani","role":"","photo":"/oHakde9nF1zU0MHVTKPg3ukEQsA.jpg"},{"name":"سام درخشانی","role":"","photo":"/nvnSAWtouZhOAljQlu42MnYuUfh.jpg","en":"Sam Derakhshani"},{"name":"Asha Mehrabi","role":"","photo":"/jXfT8Oa862HAzLqyu3oJbZbBe41.jpg"},{"name":"Behrang Alavi","role":"","photo":"/nYHCwsPFPpwCpnTnOdRJLSArh4U.jpg"},{"name":"Elahe Hesari","role":"","photo":"/tDih8maCxXbQNRWnz3uG7l24yPv.jpg"},{"name":"Farnaz Rahnama","role":"","photo":"/lxbKjtSLQ03TmtpptxvM0t5ih0S.jpg"},{"name":"Mazdak Rostami","role":"","photo":"/uswSHK4wTcghQWtauSBMVhDZjkM.jpg"},{"name":"Siamak Atlasi","role":"","photo":"/8jJLIyuhYhAcpWzLvHvvA4ggXfx.jpg"},{"name":"Bahram Ebrahimi","role":"","photo":"/edh4DRlMOjxFZRf8V9JWvQXdnar.jpg"},{"name":"Mohammad Feyli","role":"","photo":"/6Dfh59auYMA4IdT5j1m7O6OIgpp.jpg"},{"name":"المیرا دهقانی","role":"","photo":"/6lW0AbiQ6ZT5ad0BGXnOME4qvas.jpg","en":"Elmira Dehghani"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/329460"}